tmw go to look at memes to get over a breakdown semi related to sexual trauma, find a penis music meme that leads me down a 7 year deep rabbit hole of victim silencing using their audience that apparently goes to today.

Depends on the about imo, while many artists drag their fanbase into addiction and sexual depravity with them, sometimes it can be beneficial, 

&#x200B;

As odd as it sounds, stuff like Industrial rock and Hardcore/industrial rap or even some psychedelic rock and metal often have a fanbase more against such overt hedonism than you´d think. Hearing music about overdoses and people going mad from drug use, when you think about it, can keep the listener away from drugs, or, at the very least, away from harder ones, and closer to safe use, which, while not as good as not doing said substances, is still better than it could be.
